                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've played it when I was little, now I have it in Steam and want to write a review.\r\n\r\nIt's a great small tactical and management game that handles being dropped behind enemy lines with limited support pretty well.\r\n\r\nIt strugles in places with XCOM aim... but that's part of the charm with these types of games.\r\nThe story is good enough to pay attention and have more fun.\r\n\r\nGive it a try yourselves as this is a gem from a different time.",
